        System.out.println("First page: " + driver.getCurrentUrl());
        Thread.sleep(2000);

        // Navigate to second page
        driver.navigate().to("https://www.selenium.dev/documentation");
        System.out.println("Second page: " + driver.getCurrentUrl());
        Thread.sleep(2000);

        // Go back to first page
        driver.navigate().back();
        System.out.println("After back: " + driver.getCurrentUrl());
        Thread.sleep(2000);

        // Go forward to second page
        driver.navigate().forward();
        System.out.println("After forward: " + driver.getCurrentUrl());
        Thread.sleep(2000);

        driver.quit();
    }
}
```

**Key Points:**
- `navigate().back()` goes to previous page in browser history
- `navigate().forward()` goes to next page in browser history
- `getCurrentUrl()` retrieves current page URL
- All navigation methods wait for page load

